  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home Based AIDS Care and Children&apos;s Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	To provide care and support to people infected and affected by HIV and AIDS
2.	To strengthen client referral systems through networking and collaboration with appropriate health and social service providers.
3.	To reduce socio-economic impact of HIV and AIDS to the infected and affected people, especially among the sexually active groups 
4.	To improve service delivery through continuous capacity building of the programme staff
5.	To empower PLWHA and orphans on their rights and stigma and discrimination</narrative>
  </description>
